 "remarks": "Completely renovated this September and truly move-in ready! Welcome to this beautifully updated 1-bedroom residence at 1525 E Putnam Avenue in Old Greenwich.  Bright and stylish, this home features a spacious open-concept layout, beautiful hardwood floors, recessed lighting, and a private balcony that extends the living space outdoors.  The brand-new kitchen featuring crisp white cabinetry, quartz countertops with dramatic veining, a large waterfall-style island, stainless steel appliances, modern hardware, and elegant lighting.  The fully renovated bathroom offers a fresh contemporary design with a new vanity, illuminated mirror, sleek black fixtures, and a glass-enclosed tub/shower.  The generously sized bedroom is filled with natural light, while the living area opens directly to the private balcony with peaceful views. Fresh finishes, updated doors and trim, modern lighting, and thoughtful design details throughout make this home feel brand new.  Nothing to do but move in and enjoy. Conveniently located in Old Greenwich with easy access to shopping, restaurants, transportation, downtown Greenwich, and nearby amenities. A rare opportunity to own a completely renovated, turn-key condo in a highly desirable and convenient location.",
